  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "NEW\n\t\t\t* Given<TService>().Returns(value) now applies to any method that can return the value.\n\n\t\t\tCHANGED\n\t\t\t* A nested Given heads its own section, unless that leads to level-5 heading, then they are merged to one level-4 heading\n\t\t\t* An array creation reads as the list it is: new[] { x } as [x], new int[] { x } as int[x]\n\t\t\t* A requirement that asserts nothing reads \"TODO: Assert behaviour\" instead of an empty claim\n\t\t\t* A requirement every branch repeats is listed once at the heading they share\n\t\t\t* A returns statement may be hoisted to a top-level heading, beside Subject under test\n\n\t\t\tFIXED\n\t\t\t* A second assertion no longer runs into the first: each claim starts its own line.\n\t\t\t* A cast of a collection expression is described correctly verbatim\n\t\t\t* A wrapped line no longer opens with the comma that joined it to the line above\n\t\t\t* Any string literal is described with single quotes, and holes with single brackets",
